<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending rose 2.2 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending rose 2.2 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 2.2 percent year-on-year in March, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			  March 97	Feb 1997	March 1996</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +2.2%	   +3.1% (r)     +2.8%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +2.5%	   +3.6% (r)     +6.4%</p>
<p>Deposits		+0.6%	   +2.0% (r)     +2.3%</p>
</text>
